menu "Mosaico USB diagnostics"

config MOSAICO_USB_DIAGNOSTICS
    bool "Enable bounded USB CDC diagnostics"
    depends on TINYUSB_CDC_ENABLED
    default y
    help
        Read the existing USB CDC console without enabling the Claw CLI.
        Fixed commands expose public status, queued UI input, and a real-frame
        capture provider when available. Input is never echoed. This debug
        interface is local USB only; ordinary Corallium BLE is unchanged.

endmenu
